    "description": "Little Men is a story that captures how we grow up. The film takes the question of, \"Whether girls should be allowed in the clubhouse,\" and focuses on the reality of the situation. The children, boys and girls, each realize if he or she is a leader or a follower, and struggle with this issue. The children, learning, fight to grow and to understand the next stage in their life, reminiscent for those who are already Big, and foretelling for those still Little.",
